atsuki mad. What Satsuki did to her is unknown, but Kururu wants to never anger Satsuki again."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Decided to complete her mission to destroy the world, she enters the school as a transfer student while she thinks about how to destroy the planet. When she found Kei and apologized for destroying his room, Kei, who was desperate for gathering supporters for his campaign, tricked her into becoming his supporter, in exchange to Kei giving her a curtain to block the morning sun and helping her finding a way to destroy the world...without angering Satsuki."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38977"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の部屋を破壊して突っ込んできた謎の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"記憶喪失で唯一覚えていることが自分の名前と自身が破壊神ということだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"機械帝国の出身らしく、主人公のクラスに転入してくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会選挙に立候補するため、推薦人を探していた主人公に推薦人として選挙に参加することを約束する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その代わり、主人公に世界を滅ぼす方法を一緒に考えて欲しいと提案する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近のマイブームは森林破壊（裏庭の雑草抜き）と主人公とラーメン。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7654","sourceWorkId":"22468","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の部屋を破壊して突っ込んできた謎の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"記憶喪失で、唯一覚えていることが自分の名前と自身が破壊神ということだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"機械帝国の出身らしく、主人公のクラスに転入してくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会選挙に立候補するため推薦人を探していた主人公に、推薦人として選挙に参加することを約束する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その代わり、主人公に世界を滅ぼす方法を一緒に考えてほしいと提案する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近のマイブームは、森林破壊（裏庭の雑草抜き）と主人公とラーメン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「破壊神クルルです。 好きな食べ物はとんこつラーメンです」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"36324"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"出身","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"36324","value":"機械帝国マキナインスーラ（？）"},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7654","sourceWorkId":"22468","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2ed2831e725be7d8d5fc9c5481464fd8b83adf1df81813efa347350ee892d50.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/39d38a145d22c54c2516598cced14c0c5e79850ba75354384bcaba55b046df12.webp","width":95,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"種﨑敦美","creatorId":"vndb:s196","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s196","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s196","name":"種﨑 敦美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:143613:36324:7575:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c39009","characterName":"ソフィア＝ユースティ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"36325","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"143613"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7655"],"vndbCharacterId":"c39009"},"originalCharacterName":"ソフィア＝ユースティ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The princess of the demons. On her first day on the school, she caused a commotion and her maid, Chiko, was attacking anyone that was \"rude\" to her for not respecting her as she should be. Iori intervened saying that Sofia was just being arrogant and using violence, then Sofia ordered Chico to attack Iori, but Kei intervened and protected Iori, causing Chiko to become afraid of him for his strength."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Seeing Kei's strength, Sofia got interested on him and started fighting him. Sofia was very strong, but Kei's, after constantly evading and changing places to a deserted location, ended the fight dealing a blow that opened a fissure on the ground. Kei's strength made Sofia even more interested on him and decided she would own him and decided to \"start as friends\" while she plans how to make him fall for her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"